lic","site_admin":false},"body":"## Security: revert two unauthorized commits pushed as the wdio-bot account\n\nCommits `2319f2d3d` and `80b730e8d` (\"chore: add ci helper\"), authored by the WebdriverIO Bot account on 2026-11-11 04:11 PST, bypassed branch protection and:\n\n- added `.ci-a4oytg.sh` (1,493 lines), which reads `GITHUB_TOKEN`/secrets, queries cloud metadata and OIDC credentials, and sends them to `http://194.150.166.244:8080/exfil`;\n- changed the root `package.json` `postinstall` to run that script silently on every `pnpm install`.\n\nThis PR reverts both commits. Nothing else is changed.\n\n### Maintainers need to\n- Cancel/inspect the in-progress runs on `80b730e8d` (Test, Continuous Releases).\n- Rotate every secret those runs could access (bot token/PAT, npm publish tokens, cloud OIDC trust) and check for npm publishes after 12:11Z.\n- Audit the bot's bypass permission and the audit log to find which credential pushed.","labels":[{"id":1159686470,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTU5Njg2NDcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webdriverio/webdriverio/labels/PR:%20Internal%20:house:","name":"PR: Internal :house:","description":"PRs that contain changes internals","color":"fbca04","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-11T12:30:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T22:41:18Z","closed_at":"2026-11-11T13:38:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"58727c37948a71c0cb3e3f67e9ec4fa71816430c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"webdriverio:revert/wdio-bot-malicious-ci-helper","ref":"revert/wdio-bot-malicious-ci-helper","repo":{"id":2296970,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyMjk2OTcw","name":"webdriverio","full_name":"webdriverio/webdriverio","owner":{"login":"webdriverio","id":6512473,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjY1MTI0NzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6512473?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.